      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The number is \\(\\dfrac{2}{5},\\) whose reciprocal is \\(\\dfrac{5}{2}.\\)\n\nThen \\(100 \\cdot \\dfrac{5}{2} = 250.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is D .",
